Files taken from DWM and modified for DTWM
------------------------------------------
  training/wan/train_dwm_wan.py
      DTWM training: prediction of the frames after a random-length observation (block-causal
      attention, clean history with per-token timesteps, next-chunk and hand-region loss weighting),
      spatial tactile injection (TactileTokenizer + TactileSpatialInjector), vision-only baseline
      switch, non-finite-loss guard; upstream code paths not used by DTWM were removed (SFT / VACE
      training, image-to-video conditioning, Wan2.1 CLIP path, pre-encoded latents, empty-prompt
      mode, in-training validation, SLURM/debug output modes, 8-bit Adam, hand dropout).
  training/wan/inference.py
      DTWM inference: prediction of all future frames in one pass from the observed frames, observation pinning / clean
      history, block-causal chunks, per-clip spatial tactile inputs, vision-only and pathway-disabled
      switches, checkpoint/eval consistency guards; upstream paths not used by DTWM were removed
      (Wan2.1 / i2v pipelines, SFT checkpoints, custom-input and multi-variant modes, LightX2V).
  training/wan/dataset.py
      Loads the per-clip tactile pressure, hand centroids and a second (future) hand stream aligned to
      the sampled clip window; unused dataset classes and the pre-encoded-latent path were removed.
  training/wan/models/wan_transformer3d.py
      Block-causal self-attention mask and the tactile residual added after selected DiT blocks.
  training/wan/pipeline/pipeline_wan2_2_fun_inpaint_hand_concat.py
      Observed-prefix pinning and clean-history sampling; transformer_2 / ComfyUI paths removed.
  training/wan/diffusers_compat.py
      deepspeed is no longer hidden from importlib (required by accelerate's DummyScheduler).
  training/wan/args.py, training/wan/models/__init__.py, training/wan/pipeline/__init__.py
      Reduced to the options and modules used by DTWM.
  training/wan/configs/examples/dwm_wan22_5b_lora.yaml
      New: Wan2.2-Fun-5B-InP hand-concat LoRA configuration used by DTWM.

